@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Move by drag or labeled controls
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "KanbanBoardPage / BoardView" as page
  participant "UnfinishedTasksDialog" as dialog
  participant "IBoardService / BoardService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "BoardsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "MoveStoryCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "StoryStatusTransition / BoardPlacement" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Drop a card, Move up/down, or choose a destination in MoveStoryDialog (opened with the MoveRequest from moveRequested; its choice passed to BoardView through chosenMove)
alt Another move is pending on this board
  page --> actor : Control is aria-disabled; "Saving move..." already announced; nothing sent
else No pending move
  page -> page : Mark the move pending; increment the request generation; clear the board query so the resource aborts any read in flight; aria-disable other moves, drag and Load more; announce "Saving move..."; moveStatus Saving
  page -> page : Show the card Saving at the destination; totals stay at the latest acknowledged state
  page -> client : move(MoveStoryCommand: destination, position, story and board versions) returns a promise; stamped with board ID and generation
  client -> access : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}/board/stories/{storyId}/placement
  access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
  access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
  db --> access : Current account access
  alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
    access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads; sessionInterceptor: a 401 for the current generation calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once
    client --> page : The promise rejects with the 401 (nothing saved); navigation to sign-in destroys BoardView; the board is the return route
  else Unexpected 403 (profile P: moving cards needs only an active session)
    access --> client : 403; Denied audit; nothing changed; sessionInterceptor refreshes capabilities
    client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Forbidden: KanbanBoardPage closes any open dialog and shows the "Your access changed" toast, without Retry
  else Active session
    access -> ctrl : Authorized request
    ctrl -> validation : Send MoveStoryCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
    validation -> validation : L2-020 validate status, position and identifiers
    alt Unknown status or malformed position
      validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read or changed
      ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
      client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Settled closes any open dialog; refusal page alert with the server's reason and Reload board (no Retry, no reference ID)
    else Valid request
      validation -> handler : Handle MoveStoryCommand
      handler -> db : BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync takes the workspace lock first (bounded wait)
      alt Lock wait times out
        handler --> ctrl : Lock wait timed out: 503 with Retry-After; nothing changed
        ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unavailable)
        client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Failed with the reference ID: an open MoveStoryDialog shows its failed state, otherwise the "Couldn't move story" toast with Retry and the reference ID
      else Lock held
        handler -> db : LoadStoryPlacementsAsync reads the story, delivery mode, boards with live placements, versions and completion condition (unfinished count in one aggregate)
        alt Workspace or story not found
          handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
          ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
          client --> page : The promise rejects; end pending; moveStatus Settled closes any open dialog; a new first-batch query reloads the board: without the story, the board announces that it was deleted; if the project was deleted, that read returns 404 and the board shows the project's not-found presentation (Back to projects; no Try again or reference ID) and emits notFound. When a closed dialog or the removed card (Move up or Move down) held focus, focus moves to the board region, or to the not-found heading
        else Delivery mode changed after the board loaded
          handler --> ctrl : 409 mode-changed; nothing changed
          ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (mode changed)
          client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Settled closes any open dialog; no board-changed alert; BoardView emits modeChanged
          page -> page : KanbanBoardPage calls ProjectLayoutPage.modeChanged(): the header reloads and BoardModeGuard re-matches the Board tab to SprintBoardPage
        else Stale story or board version; story left the sprint
          handler --> ctrl : 409 board-changed; nothing changed
          ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (board changed)
          client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Settled closes any open dialog; page alert, never a toast: "The board changed after it loaded, so your move wasn't applied."; Reload board reads a new first batch without resubmitting
        else Board outside the story's workspace, or position outside the column (versions current, so a malformed request)
          handler --> ctrl : 400 invalid reference; nothing changed
          ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
          client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Settled closes any open dialog; refusal page alert with the server's reason and Reload board (no Retry, no reference ID)
        else Done with unfinished tasks; condition absent or no longer current
          handler -> entity : L2-021 StoryStatusTransition applies StoryCompletionPolicy: sent condition missing or not current
          entity --> handler : Confirmation required; nothing changed
          handler --> ctrl : 409 unfinished-tasks with count and StoryCompletionCondition; nothing changed
          ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unfinished-tasks)
          client --> page : The promise rejects with the condition; the move stays pending; moveStatus ConfirmationRequired with the card and condition
          page -> dialog : An open MoveStoryDialog closes with ConfirmationRequired; KanbanBoardPage opens UnfinishedTasksDialog with the card's key, title and saved status and the returned count; focus Keep in progress
          note right of dialog : Keep in progress and Mark story Done continue in "Confirm a Done move on a board"
        else Move permitted
          handler -> entity : L2-020 StoryStatusTransition sets the status and moves every live placement (a same-column reorder repositions the requested board only)
          entity --> handler : Requested placement; compacted source; appended placements on other boards
          handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 AddAuditEvent registers the success audit; SaveChangesAsync checks tracked versions and commits story, placements, board versions and the active sprint's version on a status change (not on a same-column reorder)
          alt Commit fails
            db --> handler : Roll back business state and success audit
            handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID (L2-043); diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads
            ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
            client --> page : The promise rejects; restore the latest acknowledged state; end pending; moveStatus Failed with the reference ID: an open MoveStoryDialog shows its failed state, otherwise the "Couldn't move story" toast with Retry and the reference ID
          else Commit succeeds
            db --> handler : New story and board versions
            handler --> ctrl : MoveStoryResult
            ctrl --> client : 200 with board ID, placement and versions
            client --> page : The promise resolves with the result, stamped with the request's board ID and generation
            alt Board ID or generation no longer current (board left or reloaded)
              page -> page : Discard the result; no state change
            else Current
              page -> client : Set the board query to the loaded window of the source column, then the destination column (batches of at most 100, current generation); boardResource reads each batch (authorized as above)
              alt Re-read fails
                client --> page : Resource status error: keep the confirmed placement; that column shows its alert with Retry (reads the batch again) and the reference ID only when the response carried one
              else Columns resolve
                client --> page : Resolved columns with full counts and the new board version become the latest acknowledged state
              end
              page --> actor : End pending; moves and Load more available again; moveStatus Settled with the destination and position as its announcement closes any dialog; KanbanBoardPage shows the success toast through TOAST_SERVICE
            end
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
note over page, client
No response (timeout or network failure) is never treated as a failure:
set the board query to the source and destination columns' loaded window,
adopt the resolved columns as the latest acknowledged state and announce
where the story is before another move; moveStatus Settled then closes any
open dialog. If that read fails, show the board load error saying the move
could not be confirmed, with Reload board; moves stay paused until a read succeeds.
end note
@enduml
